{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42293","headline":"奉和七夕应令 · 徐铉","name":"奉和七夕应令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今宵星汉共晶光，应笑罗敷嫁侍郎。\n斗柄易倾离恨促，河流不尽後期长。\n静闻天籁疑鸣佩，醉折荷花想艳妆。\n谁见宣猷堂上宴，一篇清韵振金铛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}